    "notes": "First collection. Birth date: Wikidata says 28 Oct 1973, Wikipedia infobox says 29 Oct 1973 — used Wikidata date. Malay naming convention: Supaat is patronymic, not surname. Chinese name confirmed as 安迪 per Parliament page. Saktiandi served as GPC Transport Chairman in 14th Parliament (2020-2025) and moved to GPC Finance & Trade Chairman + Manpower Deputy Chair in 15th Parliament (2025-present). Wife's name not publicly disclosed. Three children. Electoral history: 2015 (73.59%), 2020 (67.26%), 2025 (75.18%)."
